# Build context stays small and caches stay warm.
# The API image builds ONLY src/FuelFlow.API — everything here is dead weight.
**/bin/
**/obj/
tests/

# Local tooling and editor state
.vs/
.idea/
**/.DS_Store
*.user

# Docs are not part of the build
**/*.md

# Never bake environment files into an image layer
**/.env
**/.env.*
